<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="sv">
<head>
<%- include('components/head-base', {
  pageTitle: 'Betalning misslyckades - Mikael Dolfe',
  pageDescription: 'Din betalning kunde inte genomföras',
  canonicalPath: '/payment/failure',
  ogImage: absoluteUrl('/assets/favicon.svg'),
  ogType: 'website'
}) %>
    <style>
        .failure-container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 2rem;
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 8rem; /* Add space for fixed header */
        }
        
        .failure-icon {
            width: 80px;
            height: 80px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e74c3c, #c0392b);
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin: 0 auto 2rem;
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            color: white;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        
        .failure-title {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            color: #2c3e50;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
        }
        
        .failure-message {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: #7f8c8d;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        
        .help-section {
            background: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 2rem;
            border-radius: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            text-align: left;
        }
        
        .help-section h3 {
            color: #2c3e50;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        .help-list {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
        }
        
        .help-list li {
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            padding-left: 1.5rem;
            position: relative;
            color: #2c3e50;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
        
        .help-list li::before {
            content: "•";
            color: #3498db;
            font-weight: bold;
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
        }
        
        .contact-info {
            background: #e8f4fd;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            border-left: 4px solid #3498db;
        }
        
        .contact-info h4 {
            color: #3498db;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }
        
        .contact-info p {
            color: #2c3e50;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
        
        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 1rem 2rem;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3498db, #2980b9);
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            margin: 0.5rem;
        }
        
        .btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(52, 152, 219, 0.4);
        }
        
        .btn-secondary {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #95a5a6, #7f8c8d);
        }
        
        .btn-secondary:hover {
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(149, 165, 166, 0.4);
        }
        
        .btn-danger {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e74c3c, #c0392b);
        }
        
        .btn-danger:hover {
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(231, 76, 60, 0.4);
        }
        
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .failure-container {
                padding: 1rem;
                margin-top: 10rem; /* Extra space for mobile header */
            }
            
            .failure-title {
                font-size: 2rem;
            }
            
            .failure-icon {
                width: 60px;
                height: 60px;
                font-size: 2rem;
                margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            }
            
            .failure-message {
                font-size: 1.1rem;
                margin-bottom: 2rem;
            }
            
            .help-section,
            .contact-info {
                padding: 1.5rem;
            }
            
            .btn {
                display: block;
                width: 100%;
                margin: 0.5rem 0;
                text-align: center;
            }
        }
        
        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .failure-container {
                padding: 0.5rem;
            }
            
            .failure-title {
                font-size: 1.8rem;
            }
            
            .failure-icon {
                width: 50px;
                height: 50px;
                font-size: 1.8rem;
            }
            
            .help-section,
            .contact-info {
                padding: 1rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('components/header') %>

    <main>
        <div class="failure-container">
            <div class="failure-icon">✗</div>
            <h1 class="failure-title">Betalning misslyckades</h1>
            <p class="failure-message">
                <%= errorMessage || 'Tyvärr kunde din betalning inte genomföras. Din beställning har inte registrerats och inga pengar har dragits från ditt konto.' %>
            </p>
            
            <div class="help-section">
                <h3>Möjliga orsaker</h3>
                <ul class="help-list">
                    <li>Otillräckliga medel på ditt kort</li>
                    <li>Kortet har upphört att gälla</li>
                    <li>Felaktig kortinformation</li>
                    <li>Banken blockerade transaktionen</li>
                    <li>Tekniskt fel under betalningen</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            
            <div class="contact-info">
                <h4>Behöver du hjälp?</h4>
                <p>
                    Om du fortsätter att ha problem med betalningen, tveka inte att kontakta oss. 
                    Vi hjälper dig gärna att slutföra din beställning.
                </p>
            </div>
            
            <div>
                <a href="#" class="btn btn-danger" id="retry-button">Försök igen</a>
                <a href="/" class="btn">Tillbaka till startsidan</a>
                <a href="/#bocker" class="btn btn-secondary">Se fler böcker</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <%- include('components/footer') %>

    <script src="/assets/scripts/script.js"></script>
    <script>
        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {
            const retryButton = document.getElementById('retry-button');
            if (retryButton) {
                retryButton.addEventListener('click', function(e) {
                    e.preventDefault();
                    history.back();
                });
            }
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>


